   "description": "<h3><strong>This version will only work for SPT 4.1.x</strong></h3>\n<p>New Features</p>\n<ul>\n<li>BrightLasers is no longer a bundle mod. This will remove the conflict with WTT’s Content Backport.</li>\n<li>Due to no longer being a bundle mod, you can set your own settings. Fun. Exciting. Woo.</li>\n<li>Available settings: Beam Width, Intensity, Factor, Override Laser Colour, RGB Cycling, Colour Shifting</li>\n</ul>\n<p>NOTE: Because it is no longer a bundle mod, the server component simply now exists to yell at you for not deleting the old bundles (if you have the old version.) Do what it says if you want to live.</p>\n",
